Bind Npc 16095 Zone 31

On greeting
    Say "Do you wish to enter the Lost Chamber to face Ultima? You will need a Crystal of Trial to unlock the portal."
    Topic "Enter the Lost Chamber." goto enter_chamber
    Topic "Craft Crystal of Trial." goto craft_crystal
    Topic "Cancel" goto close
    Goto close

On enter_chamber
    If player has 389190000
        Take 1 of 389190000
        If player leads a party
            Teleport party to 31 at 940 186
        Else
            Teleport 31 at 940 186
    Else
        Say "You do not have a Crystal of Trial. You need to obtain one before entering the Lost Chamber."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Goto close

On craft_crystal
    If player has 389160000 and player has 389161000 and player has 389162000 and player has 389163000 and player has 389164000 and player has 389165000 and player has 389166000
        Take 1 of 389160000
        Take 1 of 389161000
        Take 1 of 389162000
        Take 1 of 389163000
        Take 1 of 389164000
        Take 1 of 389165000
        Take 1 of 389166000
        Give 1 of 389190000
        Say "The fragments of sin merge into a Crystal of Trial! You may now use it to enter the Lost Chamber."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Else
        Say "To craft a Crystal of Trial, you need 1x of each of the 7 Fragments of Sin (Arrogance, Gluttony, Rage, Sloth, Lechery, Jealousy, and Avarice)."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Goto close

